{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious being is held captive within your father\u2019s research centre. You swear an allegiance to this formidable beast in a desperate attempt to save your daughter from a terminal illness. Forge symbiosis with the creature in exchange for its freedom and the promise of a cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the research facility as an unassuming scientist, interacting with co-workers and the environment to gather information and release the beast. Shapeshift into the beast\u2019s monstrous form to traverse air ducts and blood brawl your way through soldiers and other creatures in the lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A father faced with a heart-wrenching situation requires acts of desperation and sacrifice. Release the beast inside and save your daughter through any means possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One nightmare cures another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/ebea2ed16e192ee11a0a8d830c8629ee.avif?t=1761249656\" width=780 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/b0630b28d33cbb9115945eebf244dc81.poster.avif?t=1761249656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/b0630b28d33cbb9115945eebf244dc81.webm?t=1761249656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/b0630b28d33cbb9115945eebf244dc81.mp4?t=1761249656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Assume two roles, human and beast \u2013 strategically choosing the right form in certain situations. Use both forms to overcome levels in the most practical way. Both forms carry deep meaning and contribute to the narrative; who you kill as the beast will affect the end of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/8bc2d109f0b5dd35a17c96589e3117e0.avif?t=1761249656\" width=780 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/dc71b68f7ecc474551b159e38579b821.poster.avif?t=1761249656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/dc71b68f7ecc474551b159e38579b821.webm?t=1761249656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/dc71b68f7ecc474551b159e38579b821.mp4?t=1761249656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The vulnerability of your slow, human form starkly contrasts with the beast\u2019s devastating executions and agility. Tear apart soldiers who stand in your way. Innocent spilt blood grants passive upgrades and unlocks executions... but this choice bears heavy consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/6c538ced72cae3e7515e8db936915262.avif?t=1761249656\" width=780 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/be8f3da168dc3518635643186dd1ea67.poster.avif?t=1761249656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/be8f3da168dc3518635643186dd1ea67.webm?t=1761249656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/extras/be8f3da168dc3518635643186dd1ea67.mp4?t=1761249656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions are yours to carry, affecting the fate of the monster and your child. Face moral dilemmas that require reflective responses throughout. Short and meaningful dialogue options allow you to delve deeper into the story and uncover secrets, forging emotional connections with characters along the way.  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3086670?t=1761249656","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/edf2693c9859f8673946c0c7bc6cc48c4523ae0d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761249656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/f1995d67a0c6574aebd7b174ab415e09ba20ca13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761249656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086670/f1995d67a0c6574aebd7b174ab415e09ba20ca13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761249656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains pixelated violence and gore not suitable for young players. \r\n\r\nUse of tobacco.\r\n\r\nInfrequent use of mild language.\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious being is held captive within your father\u2019s 